msgid ""
"<qt><b>Shred source file:</b><br />\n"
"<p>Checking this option will shred (overwrite several times before erasing) "
"the files you have encrypted. This way, it is almost impossible that the "
"source file is recovered. But <b>you must be aware that this is not "
"absolutely secure</b> on all file systems, and that parts of the file may "
"have been saved in a temporary file or in the spooler of your printer if you "
"previously opened it in an editor or tried to print it. Only works on files "
"(not on folders).</p></qt>"
msgstr ""

